  "comments": "<p><strong>Obverse:</strong><br>Type <strong>1</strong> - large script. Letter <i>T</i> in <i>CENTRAL</i> very close to <i>N</i> and <i>R</i>. (1994 to 2000)<br>Type <strong>2</strong> - smaller script. Letter <i>T</i> in <i>CENTRAL</i> far from <i>N</i> and <i>R</i>. (2001 to 2009)<br><i>Note</i>. Types 1 and 2 describe the two main groups; specific year may have individual features. For example in 2008, the script is thicker and letter<i> B</i> in <i>BANCO</i> is lower.<br><br><strong>Reverse:</strong><br>Type <strong>A</strong> - script thinner. Letter <i>V</i> in <i>NUEVOS</i> is aligned. (1994 to 2001)<br>Type <strong>B</strong> - script thicker. Letter <i>V</i> in <i>NUEVOS</i> is smaller. (2002 to 2009)<br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5b503a941890d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5b503a941890d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Edge:</strong></p><p>Type <strong>I</strong> - Plain (1995 to 2008)</p><p>Type <strong>II</strong> - Reeded (1995 and 2009)</p>",
